ay.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2  announces its net \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  position after its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  every Monday, including on Reuters page <LVBANK11>. (Reporting by David Mardiste; Editing by Toby Chopra)\par \par \uc2 BALTIC-RESERVES/|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|DA|FN|NW|SW   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100305e635000si\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
