oreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  assets firmed to 43.3 billion kroons ($3.97 bln) in December from 41.7 billion kroons at the end of November, the Estonian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on its website on Thursday.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2  announces its net position after its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  every Monday, including on Reuters page <LVBANK11>. (Reporting by David Mardiste and Nerijus Adomaitis; Editing by Toby Chopra)\par \par \uc2 BALTIC-RESERVES/|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|DA|FN|NW|SW    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100107e617000rw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
