 payments from the rescue package.\par \par \uc2 Interbank overnight rates were quoted at 0.92/2.1 percent last Friday after hitting heights of 30 percent during devaluation pressure in late May and early June.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has repeatedly rejected the devaluation option. (Reporting by Nerijus Adomaitis; editing by Chris Pizzey)\par \par \uc2 LATVIA-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 /|LANGEN|ABN|M|D   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020091005e5a5000eu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
