\par\par \b \uc2 Latvia c.bank did not trade any  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\uc2  last week\b0\par\par\uc2 260 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Juli 2009\par 09:11\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 RIGA, July 20 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Monday it did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  last week to buy or sell euros, after several weeks of selling lats and buying euros, as confidence in the lat \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  remained stable.\par \par \uc2 A week before, the bank bought 34 million euros.\par \par \uc2 The lat had been on the firm end of its trading band since mid-June when the pressure on the lat and the threat of devaluation eased after the country received funding from the European Commission.\par \par \uc2 Talks for more funding from the IMF are still ongoing.\par \par \uc2 The euro was quoted in early trade at 0.6998/7008 lats, close to the strong end of the lat's pegged band to the euro.\par \par \uc2 Interbank rates have also dropped, with the overnight rate being quoted at 2.08 percent for Rigibor and 0.74 percent for Rigibid after hitting record highs of 30 percent during the devaluation scare.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announces its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday for the previous week, including on the Reuters page <LVBANK11>.\par \par \uc2 The pressure is off for the time being, but economists say devaluation fears could re-emerge if the country fails to get further funding from the International Monetary Fund and EU.\par \par \uc2 The IMF has yet to approve further lending to Latvia, though the EU is to give a further 1.2 billion euros to Latvia this month. (Reporting by David Mardiste, editing by Mike Peacock)\par \par \uc2 LATVIA-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 /|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|DA|FN|NW|SW   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090723e57k000hl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
