 a billion euros of reserves in supporting the lat.\par \par \uc2 As of the end of February, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had 4.2 billion euros of convertible foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in its reserves. (Reporting by Patrick Lannin, editing by Mike Peacock)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-LAT/|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090325e53p0013w\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
