\par\par \b \uc2 Latvian lat weakens to c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  level\b0\par\par\uc2 176 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Februar 2009\par 15:48\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 RIGA, Feb 25 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell against the euro on Wednesday to the level where the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said and Reuters data showed.\par \par \uc2 The drop in the lat came a day after \uc2 Standard & Poor's\uc2  reduced its rating on the Baltic state to junk level.\par \par \uc2 An economic crisis and government instability have also overshadowed the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . By 1441 GMT, the euro was quoted at 0.7089/99 lats <EURLVL=>.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the euro hits 0.7098 lats.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  calls its system of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  passive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  as banks go to it to sell euros, rather than the bank moving into the market itself.\par \par \uc2 The lat has a 1 percent fluctuation band against the euro, with the bank buying lats when it hits the weak end of the band and selling them when it reaches the strong end. (Reporting by Patrick Lannin; Editing by Victoria Main)\par \par \uc2 LATVIA-LAT/ (URGENT)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|DA|FN|NW|SW   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090225e52p0014q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
