\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Latvia \highlight\uc2  c.bank chief says to keep  \highlight22\uc2 intervening \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 360 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2007\par 13:37\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds quotes, background)   \par \par \uc2 RIGA, March 28 (Reuters) - Latvian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief Ilmars Rimsevics said on Wednesday the bank would keep \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the lat \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has been stuck at the lower end of its band against the euro since mid-February.   \par \par \uc2 "A devaluation would not be the cure, it would be the poison," Rimsevics told a news conference, repeating earlier assurances that the bank had no plans devalue the lat.   \par \par \uc2 "As long as the current account deficit is supported by long-term finances, there is no risk to the lat," he added.   \par \par \uc2 The bank had given no thought to widening the euro trade band of the lat, now set at +/- 1 percent around a central rate.   \par \par \uc2 "We are more than happy to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  whenever it is necessary and we will continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  for as long as it is necessary," Rimsevics said. He was speaking to journalists after a debate on the economy at a local university.   \par \par \uc2 The lat, over which the bank last week spent 195 million euros in support, was quoted at 0.7096/01 to the euro by 1220 GMT.   \par \par \uc2 Danske Bank analyst Lars Christensen said he wanted to see a strong action plan from the government to fight inflation and the other imbalances which have got some investors worried and helped keep the lat at the lower end of its band.   \par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief is saying he will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  as long as needed. But he can \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  only as long as he has the \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves and he has used up almost 10 percent of his reserves in two weeks," Christensen added.   \par \par \uc2 "What I want to see is a strong policy statement from the government announcing measures to counter this situation. The measures have to be large, significant and credible, unlike the ones they announced a few weeks back," he added.   \par \par \uc2 The government recently announced a plan to fight inflation, involving moving to a balanced budget and then a surplus faster than planned. (additional reporting by Sujata Rao in London)   \par \par \uc2 LATVIA-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 / (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|BNX   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070331e33s000bn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
