\par\par \b \uc2 Latvia sold 195.5 mln euros to support lat  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 101 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2007\par 10:12\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 STOCKHOLM, March 26 (Reuters) - Latvia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Monday it last week sold a net 195.5 million euros in "passive" \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the lat \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , up from 65 million euros the prior week.  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data <LVBANK11> released on Monday showed the bank made the sales between March 19 and 25.  \par \par \uc2 The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2  began \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  earlier this month to support a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  under pressure as local banks were rebuilding stocks of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 LATVIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2 / (URGENT)|LANGEN|ABN|D|M|RNP|PTD  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070326e33q000ly\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
