22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Latvia engages in passive intevention whenever the lat threatens to break through the limints of its band against the SDR. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020110dy1a00me5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
