\par\par \b \uc2  Latvian lat near  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 , seen easing. \b0\par\par\uc2 361 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Dezember 2001\par 10:21\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  RIGA, Dec 4 (Reuters) - The Latvian lat held steady on Tuesday, but dealers said it was set to weaken by the end of the month as fresh funds enter the market after a eurobond issue in November. \par \par \uc2  At 0850 GMT, the lat was four points off the strongest level the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  allows it to hit. It traded six points off the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level early on Monday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it had bought 106.55 million euros ($95.52 million) from the state treasury, which it received from the sale of the seven-year eurobond. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they expected liquidity to improve as these funds would either be deposited with local commercial banks or with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which in its turn allots liquidity through its daily repo auctions. \par \par \uc2  "Taking into account that rates are unlikely to rise considerably, that Christmas and the end of the year are approaching, I think that the lat has to weaken," said Vereinsbank \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer Andrejs Greivulis. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said it was still difficult to predict a level to which the local unit could ease, but the market is mindful of the fact that it usually slides at the end of the year due to seasonal factors. \par \par \uc2  Improving liquidity is expected to keep local interbank rates in check and possibly narrow the diffirential between the lat rates and interest on SDR \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The wide differential has kept the local unit at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level in recent months. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's average overnight rate stood at 5.34/6.03 percent on Monday compared to 6.03/6.63 percent a month ago. \par \par \uc2  On the local \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market the dollar was 0.6260/65 against the lat compared to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rate of 0.6256/383, where it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  within its allowed range. \par \par \uc2  The lat is pegged at 0.7997 to the IMF's world \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket, the SDR - which includeds the dollar, the yen and other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Latvia engages in passive intevention whenever the lat threatens to break through the limits of its band against the SDR. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011204dxc400rxs\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
