\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 1-Latvian c.bank expected to  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  further. \b0\par\par\uc2 334 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Oktober 2001\par 11:07\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  RIGA, Oct 15 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it bought $9.35 million on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market last week, but the lat remained at the top of its trading band against the SDR basket on Monday, leaving expectations of further \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "There could be more (\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), because there is a demand for lats as there is a large difference between interest rates on the lat and SDR \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  portfolio manager Andrejs Viks told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  The local unit jumped to the top of its band agaist SDR last week amid a rising interest rate gap with the SDR \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  At 0829 GMT, the lat was dead even with its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level, but dealers had said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had not yet \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "I think it hasn't (\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) today.This morning there is some demand for dollars, but it is not very large to push the lat away from the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level," Unibanka \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer Kristaps Strazds said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers expected the lat to remain close to the top of its two percent band until short-term interbank interest rates ease. \par \par \uc2  On Friday, the average overnight rate was 5.90/6.51 percent, compared to 4.70/5.35 percent a mong ago. \par \par \uc2  Local rates are being kept high by a tighter stance of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has cut daily liquidity offerings through its repo auctions to about one million lats versus seven million as recently as September 21. \par \par \uc2  On the local market, the dollar was 0.6182/86 against the lat, while the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rate was 0.6182/307, where it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  within its allowed range. \par \par \uc2  The lat is pegged at 0.7997 to the IMF's world \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket, the SDR - which includeds the dollar, the yen and other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Latvia engages in passive intevention whenever the lat threatens to break through the limits of its band against the SDR. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011015dxaf00idp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
