\par\par \b \uc2  Latvian lat strong, seen headed to  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 312 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Oktober 2001\par 11:38\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  RIGA, Oct 9 (Reuters) - The Latvian lat eased slightly within its band against the SDR on Tuesday but was still strong after recent gains and dealers expected it hit \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  this week. \par \par \uc2  At 0915 GMT the lat was five points off its top \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level - the strongest point it is allowed to reach in its two percent band against the SDR basket. It closed some two to three points off \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The lat shot up late last week from around 35 points off \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as stronger interest rates in \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2  buoyed the local unit within its trading band. \par \par \uc2  "To keep a long position in lats is fairly attractive right now," said Unibanka dealer Kristaps Strazds. \par \par \uc2  Average offered three-month Latvian interbank rates are currently 6.85 percent, about 400 basis points above levels for the SDR basket, dealers say. \par \par \uc2  The rates are being kept high by a tighter stance by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has cut daily liquidity offerings through its repo auctions to about one million lats versus seven million as recently as September 21. \par \par \uc2  "That is why rates are so high in Latvia at the moment," said Strazds. "So mostly banks use Lombard facilities now." \par \par \uc2  "I think it is quite probable that there will be \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  this week," he added. \par \par \uc2  On the local market, the dollar was 0.6146/51 against the lat, while the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rate was 0.6141/265, where it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  within its two percent band against the SDR. \par \par \uc2  The lat is pegged at 0.7997 to the IMF's world \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket, the SDR - which includes the dollar, the yen and other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  It is allowed to fluctuate in a band of one percent either side. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  engages in passive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  whenever it leaves that range. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011009dxa900ida\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
