\par\par \b \uc2  Latvian lat eases in band, seen slipping further. \b0\par\par\uc2 339 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Juli 2001\par 11:57\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  RIGA, July 19 (Reuters) - The Latvian lat eased further in its band againt the SDR basket on Thursday as dealers said lower lending rates and emerging market worries were pushing it lower. \par \par \uc2  At 0942 the lat was 19 points off its top \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level - the strongest point it is allowed to reach in its two percent band against the SDR basket - versus about 15 at midday on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  "The trend is moving away from the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level of the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Arvids Sipols, co-head of trading at Parex Bank. \par \par \uc2  "I think it is related to the situation in emerging markets.... External factors are affecting \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  flows into the country." \par \par \uc2  Dealers have said 20 points is a key level to watch as a recent liquidity squeeze would make it difficult for the lat to break significantly lower than that level this month. \par \par \uc2  However, money market liquidity has been slowly loosening up and the dollar has also seen fresh falls, which could prompt unexpected bargain hunting for the greenback. \par \par \uc2  However, the July 24 settlement date for the auction of a two percent stake-owned in utility Latvian Gas could work in the lat's favour if it spur enough activity on the interbank market, which is still fairly tight. \par \par \uc2  The auction would give the state proceeds of at least 2.86 million lats ($4.52 million) if it goes through, based on the minimum price set for the shares. \par \par \uc2  At 0942 on the local market, the dollar was 0.6299/04 against the lat, while the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rate was 0.6280/407, where it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  within its two percent band against the SDR. \par \par \uc2  The lat is pegged at 0.7997 to the IMF's world \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket, the SDR - which includes the dollar, the yen and other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  It is allowed to fluctuate in a band of one percent either side. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  engages in passive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  whenever it leaves that range. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010719dx7j00kdv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
