\par\par \b \uc2  Latvian lat seen set for more liquidity squeezes. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Martins Gravitis \par \uc2 555 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Juli 2001\par 11:47\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  RIGA, July 18 (Reuters) - Latvia's money market squeeze may be showing signs of easing but analysts say recent trends show it will be back, keeping funds tight until year-end. \par \par \uc2  Tight funds pushed overnight rates above eight percent at the end of June. These have since climbed down, with one-day RIGIBID/RIGIBOR rates down to 6.45/7.01 percent on Tuesday . \par \par \uc2  Latvia has seen cycles of three to four month liquidity squeezes recently, with overnight rates peaking higher every time since last autumn - from some 6.0 last November and 7.0 percent this February to 8.4 percent at end-June. \par \par \uc2  Analysts say the pattern of recurrent liquidity crunches will repeat itself, although the growth in interest rate peaks may have reached its limit. \par \par \uc2  "If current conditions remain unchanged, rates should not exceed the 7.5 percent level and 8.0 percent on the offer side, as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  provides financing via its Lombard loans at 7.5 percent," Ivita Steinberga, head of Treasury at Nordea told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  Analysts have blamed a number of factors for the tight liquidity - large issues of government debt, scant funds offered by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  amid a booming economy and a scramble by commercial banks to finance their reserves amid growth in their sector. \par \par \uc2  They say the country's rising budget deficit - up to 1.82 percent of GDP from the 1.68 percent initial plan - is also limiting how much liquidity the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  can offer through repurchase auctions and other \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "As long as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  keeps its Lombard rates between 5.5-6.5-7.5 percent, lat rates on the interbank market can keep fluctuating between 5.0-8.0 percent each month," said Dainis Barups, head of Capital Markets and Investment Banking with Parex Bank. \par \par \uc2  The lat has been trading in ranges near the strongest levels it is allowed to hit in its SDR band on the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market amid the money market squeeze. This led the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  during the last week in June, buying $2.5 million. \par \par \uc2  "We could expect the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to be pushed into \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  again sooner or later. We are quoting our longer-term rates with that in mind," said Maris Nelsons, a dealer with Hansabanka. \par \par \uc2  In the short term, this week's auction of a two percent stake in Latvian Gas and one-year Treasury bill sale, worth 12.0 million lats, are unlikley to usher in much more activity. \par \par \uc2  "About the Gas auction, those couple of million lats could only push it a couple of points further closer to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's strongest \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level, not more. It has been staying between 10-15 points off it in recent days," Janis Paplavskis, a dealer with Parex said. \par \par \uc2  The one-year Treasury bond has been seen by market watchers being partially sold at best. \par \par \uc2  Analysts also said the interbank rate jump is not seen translating into more painful rates for corporate borrowers before autumn. \par \par \uc2  "In sectors growing fast, revenues and volumes should be able to compensate for the rate hike, while the ones which see a lower-than-average expansion could face some problems but not before autumn," said Ansis Grasmanis, vice-president of Unibanka said. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010718dx7i00hr9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
