\par\par \b \uc2  Latvian lat keeps distance from  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 338 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Juli 2001\par 10:37\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  RIGA, July 9 (Reuters) - The Latvian lat kept its distance from the top of its band in paper-thin trade early on Monday, but dealers said it would not go too far for now. \par \par \uc2  The lat was 11 points off its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level, just weaker than the position of nine pips it held early on Friday. \par \par \uc2  "I think the lat will be five to 20 points from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and it will stay in this range for July," said Hansabanka dealer Sandris Pavlovs. \par \par \uc2  Only significant \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to ease interest rates would move it more, he said. \par \par \uc2  At 0827 GMT on the local market, the dollar was 0.6370/74 against the lat, while the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rate was 0.6359/488, where it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  within its two percent band against the SDR. \par \par \uc2  The lat has been trading in ranges near the stongest levels it is allowed to hit amid a recent money market squeeze that led the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  during the week before last, buying $2.5 million. \par \par \uc2  Analysts have blamed a number of factors for the tight liquidity - large issues of government debt, scant funds offered by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  amid a booming economy and a scramble by commercial banks to finance their reserves amid growth in their sector. \par \par \uc2  They say the country's rising budget deficit is also limiting how much liquidity the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  can offer through repurchase auctions and other \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The dollar's slide on Friday and Monday after a weaker than expected U.S. jobs report is also seen as an aid in keeping the lat from strengthening to the top of its band for now. \par \par \uc2  The lat is pegged at 0.7997 to the IMF's world \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket, the SDR - which includes the dollar, the yen and other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  It is allowed to fluctuate in a band of one percent either side. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  engages in passive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  whenever it leaves that range. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010709dx7900hao\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
