\par\par \b \uc2  Latvian lat perched near top of SDR band. \b0\par\par\uc2 337 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Juli 2001\par 12:11\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  RIGA, June 2 (Reuters) - The Latvian lat remained near the stronger end of its trading band against the SDR in trade by midsession on Monday and dealers said it would only take a few large orders to drive the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the top. \par \par \uc2  However, dealers said trade had been quiet so far and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  seemed unlikely. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2  told Reuters earlier on Monday it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  last week, buying $2.5 million. \par \par \uc2  "It doesn't seem that there will be \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , although if there are any large buyers...then we will see \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Unibanka dealer Kristaps Strazds. \par \par \uc2  At 1002 GMT the lat was three points off the top end of its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band on the bid side. The local unit has traded in ranges near here in recent weeks amid a liquidity squeeze on the local money market. \par \par \uc2  Average overnight interbank offered rates were at 8.19 percent on Friday, versus their most recent lows of 1.19 percent on March 29. \par \par \uc2  Analysts have blamed a number of factors for the tight liquidity recently - large issues of government debt, low liquidity offered by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  amid a booming economy and a scramble by commercial banks to finance their reserves amid growth in their sector. \par \par \uc2  The say the country's rising budget deficit could also be limiting how much liquidity the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  can offer through repurchase auctions and other \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  On the local market the dollar was 0.6362/67 against the lat, while the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rate was 0.6359/487, where it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  within its two percent band against the SDR basket. \par \par \uc2  The lat is pegged at 0.7997 to the IMF's SDR world \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket - which includes the dollar, the yen and other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  It is allowed to fluctuate in a band of one percent either side. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is drawn into the market automatically whenever it leaves that range. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010912dx7200bvb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
