\par\par \b \uc2  Latvian lat opens slightly off against SDR basket. \b0\par\par\uc2 312 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 September 2000\par 10:44\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  RIGA, Sept 12 (Reuters) - The Latvian lat opened slightly weaker in its band against the SDR basket on Tuesday, but still well within its recent ranges. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they expected the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to hold to its recent levels against the basket of world \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  until the start of a cash buyout of leading bank Unibanka by Swedish bank SEB . \par \par \uc2  At 0818 GMT, the lat was 28 points weaker than its strongest \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level on the bid side, versus about 25 in early Monday trade. It was also well above parity in its band against the SDR. \par \par \uc2  "The lat has not changed much in relation to the SDR basket. it is trading within a range of 26 to 27 points from the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level," said Hansabanka dealer Sandis Pavlovs. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they expected lat demand to pick up when SEB announces the timing of its buyout of Unibanka, Latvia's largest publicly traded bank, but details of that are still not known. \par \par \uc2  "There is not much happening on the interbank market, I don't see the lat strenghtening so far. When SEB will start buying, the lat will be closer to the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level, but is unlikely to reach that level," he added. \par \par \uc2  SEB has offered a cash buyout for outstanding shares in its three Baltic holdings, including Latvian Unibanka, in which it already holds a majority. \par \par \uc2  On the local market the dollar was 0.6173/78 against the lat, while the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rate was 0.6145/269, where it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  within its two percent band against the SDR basket. \par \par \uc2  The lat is pegged at 0.7997 to the IMF's SDR world \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket - which includes the dollar, the yen and other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It fluctuates in a band of one percent either side. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw9c08dee\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
