\par\par \b \uc2  Latvian lat opens up vs SDR basket but rangebound. \b0\par\par\uc2 339 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Juni 2000\par 13:14\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par RIGA, June 1 (Reuters) - The Latvian lat\tab   opened\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par slightly higher against the SDR basket on Thursday but dealers\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  saw it keeping to narrow ranges. \par \par \uc2  At 1056 GMT the lat was 34 points weaker than its strongest \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level on the bid side, versus 42 points in early \par \par \uc2  Wednesday trade. It was 21 points stronger than parity on the \par \par \uc2  offer side. \par \par \uc2  "In the band basically nothing has changed. It's about 35 \par \par \uc2  points from the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level," said one \par \par \uc2  dealer, adding that he expected it to range from about 35 to 40 \par \par \uc2  points from strongest \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the time being. \par \par \uc2  Dealers have expected the lat to retreat within its band for \par \par \uc2  weeks, but the dollar's strength made it reluctant to give up \par \par \uc2  months worth of gains on the back of bond issues and \par \par \uc2  privatisations. \par \par \uc2  The dollar reached a high of 0.6116 against the lat on May \par \par \uc2  17. \par \par \uc2  The market's dollar rate firmed to 0.6042/47 against the lat \par \par \uc2  by Thursday's midsession, versus 0.6031/36 early on Wednesday, \par \par \uc2  while the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rate was 0.6008/129, where it \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  within its two percent SDR \par \par \uc2  basket. \par \par \uc2  A strong dollar usually spurs bargain hunting for lats on \par \par \uc2  the local market, pushing it to the stronger levels of its \par \par \uc2  trading band, but the greenback's recent slide has helped the \par \par \uc2  local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  ease back toward parity in its band. \par \par \uc2  "Basically the lat is getting weaker," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  However, traders have said some banks appeared short in lats \par \par \uc2  after taking profits on recent gains and this could be helping \par \par \uc2  to halt the slide temporarily. \par \par \uc2  The lat is pegged at 0.7997 to the IMF's SDR world \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  basket - which includes the dollar, the yen and other major \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It fluctuates in a band of one percent either side. \par \par \uc2  ((Burton Frierson, Riga Newsroom +371 722 2079, fax +371 724 \par \par \uc2  3139, reuters@reuters.lv)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 2000. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010820dw6104752\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
