\par\par \b \uc2  Latvian lat opens stable, retreat from highs seen. \b0\par\par\uc2 379 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Mai 2000\par 10:54\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par RIGA, May 3 (Reuters) - The Latvian lat\tab     opened stable\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par against the SDR basket on Wednesday but dealers said the local\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  finally looked ready to retreat from its recent highs \par \par \uc2  in its trading band. \par \par \uc2  At 0838 GMT, the lat was nine points off its strongest \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level, stable compared with its open on Tuesday. It \par \par \uc2  was 51 points above parity. \par \par \uc2  "The lat is weakening a little bit. On Friday it was close \par \par \uc2  to the Bank of Latvia's bid rate, about two points off, but now \par \par \uc2  we see some lat selling and it is about 10-12 points off," said \par \par \uc2  Andrejs Greivulis, a dealer at Vereinsbank Riga. \par \par \uc2  "I think we will see some more selling and it will weaken \par \par \uc2  again. Maybe one reason it has not been weaker is because of the \par \par \uc2  dollar's strength, but I think it will weaken later on," said \par \par \uc2  Greivulis. \par \par \uc2  Dollar strength usually brings out bargain hunters for lats \par \par \uc2  on the local market. \par \par \uc2  The market's dollar rate was 0.6041/46 against the lat, \par \par \uc2  while the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rate was 0.6032/153, where it \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  within its two percent SDR band. \par \par \uc2  Dealers have been expecting the lat to slide back toward \par \par \uc2  parity for weeks but say the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has held tightly to its \par \par \uc2  gains of the last two months on the back of government bond \par \par \uc2  issues and privatisations. \par \par \uc2  However, low volumes amid holiday-shortened weeks after \par \par \uc2  Easter and May Day have helped keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  firm. \par \par \uc2  On Friday the lat spent much of the day brushing up against \par \par \uc2  its strongest \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level, although a Bank \par \par \uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2  official told Reuters it had not entered the market. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2  last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the stronger end of \par \par \uc2  the lat's band on June 15, 1998, although it was often in the \par \par \uc2  market in late 1999 to support a weak local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The lat is pegged at 0.7997 to the IMF's SDR world \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  basket -- which includes the dollar, the yen and other major \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It fluctuates in a band of one percent either side. \par \par \uc2  (( Burton Frierson, Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240, fax +371 \par \par \uc2  724 3139, reuters@reuters.lv )). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 2000. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw5301t5u\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
