\par\par \b \uc2  Latvian lat soft amid  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  signs - dealers. \b0\par\par\uc2 325 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 September 1999\par 11:02\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  RIGA, Sept 7 (Reuters) - The Latvian lat remained weak in \par \par \uc2  early Tuesday trade amid signs of continued \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  would remain soft \par \par \uc2  until a major privatisation reversed the flow of funds. \par \par \uc2      "We are all the time on the (\b \highlight22\uc2 central) Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level," said one dealer. \par \par \uc2      "I think some banks have done some deals with the Bank of \par \par \uc2  Latvia (today)," the dealer said, adding that only expected \par \par \uc2  privatisations of firms like Latvian Gas and Latvian Shipping \par \par \uc2  later this year could reverse the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  flow and firm the \par \par \uc2  lat. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par At 0845 GMT the market's offered dollar rate\tab   was\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0.5910 to the lat while the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's rate, which is also\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the level at which it \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervenes\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , was 0.5912.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  said on Monday it had sold $30 million in\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  last week and a total of $55 million last month as\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the lat remained weak amid worries about the budget deficit.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Aanalysts say the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's reserve levels remain safe\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par but no amount will be enough if foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  continues to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par drip out indefinitely.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The lat has been weak since July when worries about a gaping\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par budget deficit that is expected to reach 3.5 percent of GDP\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par forced the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  for the first time this\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par year.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par It has been in the market on an almost daily basis since\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par then, with intermittent dollar bargain hunting exacerbating lat\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par weakness.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The lat is pegged at 0.7997 lats to the SDR, the IMF's world\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par basket \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , and is allowed to fluctuate in a band of one\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par percent either side.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  does not usually enter the market when the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par lat is safely within the band but steps in more or less\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par automatically when it threatens to leave.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     ((Burton Frierson, Riga Newsroom +371 722 2079,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par reuters@reuters.lv)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1999.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv97010t1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\