\par\par \b \uc2  Latvian cbank remains in  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  mode-dealers. \b0\par\par\uc2 305 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 September 1999\par 14:11\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      RIGA, Sept 1 (Reuters) - The Latvian lat remained stuck at \par \par \uc2  the lower end of its band against the SDR basket on Wednesday as \par \par \uc2  dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  continued to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support \par \par \uc2  the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which is sagging amid worries about the budget. \par \par \uc2      "The situation isn't changing. The lat is again at the \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level and the (\b \highlight22\uc2 central) Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is in the \par \par \uc2  market," said one dealer. \par \par \uc2      "Yesterday there were some buyers from abroad but I don't \par \par \uc2  think that was speculative interest," the dealer added. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     At 1155 GMT the market's offered dollar rate\tab     was\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0.5882 against the lat while the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's rate, which is\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  level, was 0.5881\tab    .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The lat has remained weak for over a month since the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central\par \f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 \par bank intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  for the first time this year in July.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  said earlier this week it sold about $40\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par million during \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  moves in August, as intermittent\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar bargain hunting exacerbated weakness brought on by\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par worries about the budget and the health of the pension system.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Local dealers say the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's foreign reserves, 681.3\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par million lats at end-July, are at a safe level for now but the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par market still expects action on a fiscal budget deficit expected\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par to hit 3.5 percent of GDP despite earlier spending cuts.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The lat is pegged at 0.7997 lats to the SDR, the IMF's world\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par basket \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , and is allowed to fluctuate in a band of one\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par percent either side.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  does not usually enter the market when the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par lat is safely within the band but steps in more or less\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par automatically when it threatens to leave.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     ((Burton Frierson, Riga Newsroom +371 722 2079,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par reuters@reuters.lv)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1999.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv9101i6t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
