\par\par \b \uc2  Latvian lat starts weak, cbank in market-dealers. \b0\par\par\uc2 285 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 August 1999\par 11:05\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      RIGA, Aug 31 (Reuters) - The Latvian lat remained at the \par \par \uc2  lower end of its band against the SDR basket early on Tuesday as \par \par \uc2  dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had already \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to boost a \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  sagging under budget worries. \par \par \uc2      "We are at \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the (\b \highlight22\uc2 central) Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is \par \par \uc2  in the market again. There were some amounts (of dollars) bought \par \par \uc2  from them already," said one dealer. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     At 0848 GMT the market's offered dollar rate\tab     was\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0.5904 against the lat while the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's rate, which is\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  level, was also 0.5904\tab    .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The lat has remained weak for the past month since the\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  for the first time this year.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  said on Monday it had sold $40 million\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par during \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  moves so far in August, as intermittent\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar bargain hunting exaccerbated weakness brought on by\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par worries about the budget and the health of the pension system.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Local dealers say the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's foreign reserves, 681.3\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par million lats at end-July, are at a safe level for now but the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par market still expects action on a fiscal budget deficit expected\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par to hit 3.5 percent of GDP despite earlier spending cuts.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The lat is pegged at 0.7997 lats to the SDR, the IMF's world\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par basket \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , and is allowed to fluctuate in a band of one\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par percent either side.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  does not usually enter the market when the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par lat is safely within the band but steps in more or less\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par automatically when it threatens to leave.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     ((Burton Frierson, Riga Newsroom +371 722 2079,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par reuters@reuters.lv)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1999.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv8v01eb1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
